    <string name="cloud_howto_title">How to create a Cloudflare API Token</string>
    <string name="cloud_howto_body">1. Open dash.cloudflare.com → My Profile → API Tokens\n2. Tap <b>Create Token</b>\n3. Choose the <b>Edit Cloudflare Workers</b> template\n4. Leave Account Resources = All accounts\n5. Continue to summary → Create Token → copy the token\n6. Paste it here and tap Deploy on your chosen panel.</string>
