    <string name="cloud_catpanel_desc">Cat Panel v5 — your own BPB-style panel on Cloudflare: real VLESS-WS / Trojan-WS relay, clean IPs baked into every config (you pick the ports and SNI), per-user quotas on KV, password lock (UUID by default), Iranian DNS presets, in-panel + server-side scanners, QR and Clash / sing-box output. Deploy with the API token below — the app creates the KV store, sets the UUID and imports the subscription for you.</string>
